# Route: guide 48 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 60 to
# 60, 12 quests, 0.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stonetalon Mountains, Thunder Bluff): Windshear Crag -> Sun Rock
# Retreat -> Webwinder Path -> Mirkfallon Lake -> Windshear Crag -> Webwinder
# Path -> Sun Rock Retreat -> Stonetalon Peak -> near Thunder Bluff.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Earthen Arise (6481; Goggeroc 20).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing
# an Enemy's Strength (5723).

